From bdfbd71eb31cd209708b31ee35ece8a26a262dbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:30:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] release: disable the aiseal, npumanager and avf vm
 features

the exynos 850 has no npu the npumanager module can drive and no pkvm
for the aiseal host service, the early boot vm or the llpvm system
server jar, so they only add an apex, classpath jars and boot time
work. turn their cp2a release flags off; the product and classpath
wiring is gated on them.

Change-Id: I17e42ac477467ae7d0e5c3ac33656732d8381cb1
Co-authored-by: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
